WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:00.859
On pump.

00:00:00.859 --> 00:00:02.957
fun, an account is just a wallet.

00:00:02.957 --> 00:00:05.945
Every wallet in this app can have its own pump.

00:00:05.945 --> 00:00:09.505
fun account, with its own name, followers, and callouts.

00:00:09.505 --> 00:00:13.129
Making one is free, and it does not send any transaction.

00:00:13.129 --> 00:00:15.355
You need a wallet in the app first.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.598
Start on the Hub, the home screen with the big tiles.

00:00:19.598 --> 00:00:20.560
Click Automation.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:24.072
In the menu on the left, click pump.

00:00:24.072 --> 00:00:24.888
fun accounts.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:27.974
Scroll down to Accounts to make.

00:00:27.974 --> 00:00:30.953
Every wallet that has no account yet is listed here.

00:00:30.953 --> 00:00:33.360
Click Create account, next to your wallet.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:37.314
The app signs a short message with your wallet, to prove it is yours.

00:00:37.314 --> 00:00:40.580
Your key never leaves your computer, and nothing is paid.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:42.964
Got several wallets?

00:00:42.964 --> 00:00:46.479
Click Make all, and it makes an account for every one of them.

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:51.101
After a few seconds, your account shows up under Sessions.

00:00:51.101 --> 00:00:51.391
pump.

00:00:51.391 --> 00:00:54.529
fun gives it a random name, and you can type your own.

00:00:54.529 --> 00:00:56.389
A sign-in lasts about two weeks.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:59.992
When it is close to running out, a Renew button shows up here.

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:02.840
Click it, and you are good for another two weeks.

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:05.329
Already have a pump.

00:01:05.329 --> 00:01:07.064
fun account, with followers?

00:01:07.064 --> 00:01:07.807
Bring it in.

00:01:07.807 --> 00:01:10.719
If you made it with email or Google, open pump.

00:01:10.719 --> 00:01:11.958
fun in your browser.

00:01:11.958 --> 00:01:16.605
Click your picture, then View Wallet, then Export Wallet, and copy the key.

00:01:16.605 --> 00:01:19.765
Paste it in this box, and click Import and sign in.

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:24.207
You can also make the account from your Sol Wallet page.

00:01:24.207 --> 00:01:25.348
Scroll down to pump.

00:01:25.348 --> 00:01:27.917
fun accounts, and click Create account there.

00:01:27.917 --> 00:01:29.230
It does the same thing.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:31.168
That is it.

00:01:31.168 --> 00:01:32.795
Making an account is free.

00:01:32.795 --> 00:01:36.737
Sign-ins last about two weeks, so click Renew when it shows up.

00:01:36.737 --> 00:01:37.926
And remember, pump.

00:01:37.926 --> 00:01:41.743
fun only ever shows your key on its own Export Wallet screen.

00:01:41.743 --> 00:01:45.185
Anyone else who asks for your key is trying to rob you.
